// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO2/25 - dedicated dual-antenna switch
// control lines (ANT1/ANT2), not general-purpose.
// 2026-07-14 CONFIRMED via independent research: Espressif's own official
// ESP32-WROOM-DA datasheet states GPIO2/GPIO25 are RTC6603SP RF-switch
// test points "not led out to the module"; independently corroborated by
// the ESP-IDF PHY API guide's documented setDualAntennaConfig() defaults
// (gpio_ant1=2, gpio_ant2=25). See notes.txt for full source list.
